{"id":"e7019f2de1e48b82","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-pcf3-eventual-dominating-number.md","title":"ZFC Pcf3 Eventual Dominating Number","display":"df-zfc-pcf3-eventual-dominating-number — ZFC Pcf3 Eventual Dominating Number","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-pcf3-eventual-dominating-number","aliases":["58-df-zfc-pcf3-eventual-dominating-number"],"display":"df-zfc-pcf3-eventual-dominating-number — ZFC Pcf3 Eventual Dominating Number","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-pcf]]","[[58-df-ideal]]","[[58-df-zfc-pcf3-eventual-order]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-pcf3-eventual-dominating-number"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-pcf3-eventual-dominating-number</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-pcf3-eventual-dominating-number — ZFC Pcf3 Eventual Dominating Number"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b82cea6742372d50\" href=\"?note=b82cea6742372d50\" title=\"58-df-pcf\">58-df-pcf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"58-df-ideal\">58-df-ideal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fd3c35fd522d89ac\" href=\"?note=fd3c35fd522d89ac\" title=\"58-df-zfc-pcf3-eventual-order\">58-df-zfc-pcf3-eventual-order</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> (pcf product index set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b82cea6742372d50\" href=\"?note=b82cea6742372d50\" title=\"58-df-pcf\">58-df-pcf</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> (ideal/filter parameter for eventual dominance)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak d\">\\(\\mathfrak d\\)</span> (cardinal value, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ideal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ideal}\\)</span> (set-ideal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"58-df-ideal\">58-df-ideal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3EventualOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3EventualOrder}_S\\)</span> (eventual non-strict order modulo <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"fd3c35fd522d89ac\" href=\"?note=fd3c35fd522d89ac\" title=\"58-df-zfc-pcf3-eventual-order\">58-df-zfc-pcf3-eventual-order</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3EventualDominatingNumber}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3EventualDominatingNumber}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf3\\text{-}eventual\\text{-}dominating\\text{-}number}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3EventualDominatingNumber}_S(A,J,\\mathfrak d)\\leftrightarrow A\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(a)\\land\\mathrm{Ideal}(J,\\mathcal P(A))\\land A\\notin J\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mathfrak d)\\land\\mathfrak d=\\min\\{|\\mathcal F|:\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\prod A\\land\\forall g\\in\\prod A\\;\\exists f\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3EventualOrder}_S(A,J,g,f)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf3\\text{-}eventual\\text{-}dominating\\text{-}number}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3EventualDominatingNumber}_S(A,J,\\mathfrak d)\\leftrightarrow A\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(a)\\land\\mathrm{Ideal}(J,\\mathcal P(A))\\land A\\notin J\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mathfrak d)\\land\\mathfrak d=\\min\\{|\\mathcal F|:\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\prod A\\land\\forall g\\in\\prod A\\;\\exists f\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3EventualOrder}_S(A,J,g,f)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Properness of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> is expanded using the actual ideal predicate, and domination uses the existing four-argument eventual-order relation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-functi